  "historyNote": "#9655, eff 2-13-10, EXPIRED: 2-13-18 New. #12674, INTERIM, eff 11-19-18, EXPIRED: 5-20-19 New. #12795, eff 5-30-19 (formerly provisions of He-P 806.21); ss by #13987, eff 5-30-24 (formerly He-P 806.25)",
